### Admin create body metric
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/body-metrics
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "memberId": 1,
  "weightKg": 70.0,
  "heightCm": 170.0,
  "bodyFatPercent": 22.0,
  "muscleMassKg": 30.0,
  "note": "Lần đo đầu",
  "recordedAt": "2026-07-01T08:00:00"
}

### Admin get body metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/body-metrics?page=0&size=10&memberId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin get body metric detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/body-metrics/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin get body metrics by member
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/body-metrics/member/1?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin get latest body metric by member
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/body-metrics/member/1/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin update body metric
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/body-metrics/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "weightKg": 68.5,
  "heightCm": 170.0,
  "bodyFatPercent": 21.0,
  "muscleMassKg": 30.5,
  "note": "Cập nhật chỉ số"
}

### Admin delete body metric
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/body-metrics/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Member get my body metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/body-metrics/me?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### Member get my body metric detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/body-metrics/me/1
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### Member get latest my body metric
GET {{baseUrl}}/body-metrics/me/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### Member get my body metric history
GET {{baseUrl}}/body-metrics/me/history?from=2026-07-01T00:00:00&to=2026-07-31T23:59:59
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}